	)
	(text "Supply: +3.3V into VDD and VDDH tied (datasheet 8.3: Reg0 DC/DC and LDO off below 3.6 V); DCCH and VBUS unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 805.18 196.25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c2943d05-38b8-4c9e-8b9c-2130b1b7acd6")
	)
	(text "Internal 32.768 kHz RC (datasheet 8: X2 optional). UART: MCU PB6 USART1_TX(remap) -> P0.08 RXD, MCU PB7 <- P0.06 TXD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 805.18 200.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "65e40f04-7913-4dbd-b743-42f5e4d94d78")
	)
	(text "P0.14 = BLE_STATUS (connected, active low) -> D14 and MCU PC14.  MCU PB5 (open drain) -> P0.18/nRESET; J18 = SWD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 805.18 203.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ee228f54-afff-46d5-9fef-4989d83afa11")
	)
	(text "PCB: antenna end on the right board edge; datasheet 2.3 no-ground keep-out (>= 3.8 mm, every layer) under the antenna."
